# Framed-color panel erasure — current decisions

Canonical `matching`: the top-left green L frame contains a set of key colors.
Ignore multiplicity. Outside the frame, take 4-connected components of all
non-orange cells (including black). Erase every panel containing all key colors
to orange. Extra marker colors are allowed. All four supplied labels match
under protected Racket. No gold or original parent was edited.

Opt-in `palette_cascade`: initialize with the complete-key panels. Activate
their non-key marker colors, erase panels sharing an active color, and repeat
to closure. Keys and black are never propagation colors. This is a palette
connectivity rule, not spatial adjacency or global color counting. The 30x30
witness has four waves (seed stage plus three dependent hops); replacing the
seed-derived palette with all visible extras changes 81 final cells.

Sampling: 2–4 key colors, repeated key marks, one/two/three complete matches,
rectangular and notched regions, empty and repeated-color distractors, diagonal
contacts, shuffled roles/positions/palettes, 16x16 minimum profile and substantive
30x30 profile. Both settings use matched inputs. Demonstrations 2–6 and queries
1–4 are independent. A full four-query bank is shuffled before prefix selection.

Self-review: the first sampler always had two complete matches. A failing test
then a variable-count repair now teaches against an always-two selection. The
source-bound audit tool also now rejects another task's preflight, differing
program hashes, and changed execution/original-pair evidence.

Verification: 97 task tests; 64 seeds x two settings x demo counts 2,3,6 = 384
episodes and 7,296 named-rival checks; 640 distinct inputs; 42 extra protected
Racket evaluations plus causal replay; 16 public turns and seven corrupt-export
rejections. See the packaged checks/public_eval_d59b0160 release receipts.

Limits: only a top-left green L key, orange separators, black panel background,
and marker colors 1,2,4,5,6,8,9 are admitted. Generated geometry uses separated
three-by-three slots (one reserved for the key), not every possible panel layout.
The code handles more layouts than the sampler claims to cover. The finite rival
audit is not uniqueness. Causal interpretation was author-reviewed, not reviewed
by an independent agent. Preflight is not native qualification or owner acceptance;
owner semantic review, registration, qualification, acceptance and training
admission remain pending.
